Please give me a call when you read this...A letter is a shitty way to say these things, but I'd rather do that than have you phone the night before and say, ummm..don't come.Mary**schpankay**To: boboSubj: address, etc.Date: Sep  23209 East 10th, Apt. D4Bloomington, IN  47408812-330-0503**mangla**To: boboSubj: ftpDate: Sep 26Port is 4243username is mud:bobo  and password from mudcopy kelly's are over to your dir and you can ftp it.Yes you do have write acess.-Mangla answers. ;)**schpankay**To: boboSubj: addressDate: Jan 23932 East 63 PlaceMerrillville, IN  46410**redsexy**To: boboFwd:  poemCc: boboDate: Feb 25To: redsexySubj: poemDate: Feb 18She Walks in BeautyShe walks in beautySable tresses cascading her backSparkling eyes and an undying smileHer face's only clothingThese things don not neauty makeDaily meetings lessen her effect notHearts skip when she is sightsNearly die of happiness with a glanceEmbraces from this love, ecstasyThese are effects not the causeHer lips glisten in any lightFrom them magnificent phrases flowEnlighted words spring from herAided by a source hidden from sightEnchanted the ears of the listenerHer body full and sensuousAdorned with once normal garmentsMade divine by her touchFlesh peaks out teasingly brilliantThis the covering, ont the essenceDreams of Her cannot be banefulPerfection unattainable on earthHalf remembered in waking hoursParadise achieved in a dayHer impact remembered for agesThe body which pales Mona LisaThe mind which stuns Don GiovaniThis combination sheer perfectionHas captured my heart simply becauseShe walks in beauty.**teapot**To: boboSubj: mlannon_98@yahoo.comCc: xDate: Jan 19that's it =)  bye now!**griffon**To: boboSubj: addyDate: Feb 21roguee@hotmail.com**tatsuo**To: manglaSubj: ArchoodCc: akira, uruz, waldo, redsexy, bobo, wilbie, tinman, sargon, tatsuo, shadowmonk, naeDate: Mar 22This is a final effort at swaying you towards seeing a reasonable course of actionfor Holy Mission, a great game that is not fun with the people that are running itthe way it is and has been run.  I have layed out many reasons why i want to be archand i am consistantly put off and ignored.  The arches want to do everything behind closed doors.  I am sending this letter to Mangla, who of all the arches, is theonly one that codes, and has been here, and who has admittedly pointed out thathe forgets things, and misses things, because of everything that needs done.Coding for HM is something that I enjoy to the fullest, but it has not been fun.At every turn I have an archwizard speaking down at me, lying about me or atleast continuing an untrue rumor to others, THIS IS LOGGED, I have sent it to mangla.  We have archwizards who last coded 5 years ago.  We have archwizardswith outside commitments that take up space here.  We have archwizards thattake off 5 months and turn up like messiahs reasserting their rightful positionsand casting down judgements. And we have one coding arch.For 3 and one half years I watched the mud go through death throws, as playersand wizards were driven off by shitty policies, guild closings, and the mudbeing moved around( all reasons I have heard).  Sauron, of the belovedninja guild had 3.5 years to recode ninja, he also had 3.5 years toput the monk into a bin system, and do something to balance it.  It just wasn'tdone.  I do not know what he has done, but i can only speak of what wasn't done,and ask if opening and fixing these guilds was less important that what was done.There was plenty of time for these people to \"shit or get off the pot\".It wasn't done.  For those of you who do not know, or who have prescribed tothe rumors that abound.  I was banned by mistake.  I was kept away and putoff without reason.  Untrustworty was heard. All sorts of things.For the brief time i was unbanned, i was NEVER returned to my position,although it was a mistake that i lost it.  I was kept and treated asa wiz with suspicion, and comments being made about me.  It sucked.I was restored to my position.  Airborne said it was a check on Mangla.Mangla said it was to bring back HM.  Silas voted for me cause i asked him.In the time that i made elder, I restored the ninja with wilbie, tinman,and bobo, restored the summoners with redsexy.  recruited and set up7 new Gm's, reviewed and opened 5 areas, coded a clan system, and fixed2 whole areas.  There is much more that needs done.  And i log on everyday to find some social archwizard speaking down from above.  Or activeones talking down about me or to me.  Telling me what is wrong with me, and refusing to listen to all the facts established about what is wrongwith what they have done.  I have done archwizard work.  I was an archwizard.I have used elder position to help everyone on here, even the assholes.Many other wizards have been inspired to come back, but that momentum is dying.They have been put off, forgotten, while the ALL important archwizardssit back for a month to discuss things.  Redsexy was ignored for a year.Her area forgotten.  Bobo has done more coding than any other personat his rank, he is ignored and put off.  I don't blame him for cutting back.There are wizards that are banished and wanted to come back, but they areignored.  And Exos is still here even after the testimony of 7 or 8 peopleattested to his absolute wrongdoings.After the ninja guild was restored, players and wizards started calling fornew archwizards with my name being mentioned many times.  These people weretold point blank to shut the hell up.  I have no conception of whatyou arches have going on in that little room, and what bullshit ideas arefloating around.  But face it. One coding arch, isn't going to cut it.The mud blew up in sargons workroom, understandings were reached, Then ignored.That Tuesday came and went a month ago.  The old ways are no longer needed.Who is gonna help you put in the 100 level system? Airborne? Silas?Kryll?, maybe Warlord and Uglymoth.  Maybe Sauron when he comes back fromhis next extended vacation.  Hello, Tatsuo has the ability, and has shown it.The mantras of me being some evil son of a bitch won't work forever whenthey are demonstrably untrue.  You know what Redsexy is right, I am BOTH.I cannot fathom the resistance to the move when everything points to a positive.When there is a chance to remove the dead weight and move up the peoplethat are bringing back the players.  The momentum as you put it is starting to slipwith the players.  I can spark it back up.  I will claim responsibilityfor a large percent of the comeback that is started.  I give the rest to thepeople who have been ignored and put off.  From what i know, there arepotentially 3 mudlib level coders on the game besides you Mangla.Those are your archwizards.Tatsuo, Wilbie, and Sargon.Please stop bogarting the highest position in the game when others can fill those positions.  calling kryll to login hasn't made him come back and fix theplace. and saurons instant appearance also has done little but piss me off.Put the level where the level belongs.  With the people that code this place,and enjoy it.You want the 100 level system in, arch those people.You want the guilds running and balanced, arch those people.You want players coming back, arch those people.You want new players, arch those people.You want wizards coding and being helped with code, arch those people.You want Holy Mission back, arch those people.If you want things the way they were. Sit back and dicuss things some more withthe deadbeats that brought her down.Make some changes, shake the boat. Take action, make it fun.If not, I am outta here.  I have forwarded this to every wiz that gives a damn, and i will ask thatthese wizzes write their feelings to MANGLA and cc it to TATSUO.  I wanta clean and open debate.  I also ask that it not be sent to other archeswhose feelings may be hurt by it.  That is not my intention.  I i havespoken an untruth, let it be known.  If i am right, tell mangla to fix theplace.Tatsuo, for Holy Mission**wilbie**To: redsexySubj: StrikeCc: sargon, shadowmonk, nae, bobo, nunu, turbo, tinman, thumper, akira, nylakoorubDate: Mar 27I propose a coding strike, to let the arches know that we are not going toput up with their shit anymore.  They have had THREE YEARS to get this mudback together, and so far they've failed miserably.  Furthermore, they'veallowed personal vandettas to hinder the progress of the mud.I suggest the following conditions to begin coding again:1.  Reinstate Tatsuo.  That's a given.  He's done more for this mud in a    month than all of the arches did in three years.2.  Demote ALL inactive arches.  Kryll, Magnal, Sauron, Airborne.  These four    have done nothing for three years.  Sauron has been \"working on the lib\",    Airborne comes in to read boards, and Kryll hasn't done shit.  As for    Magnal - who the hell is Magnal?  3.  Mangla must either step down from arch or promote at    LEAST one more arch in order to balance the power.If you agree to this, post it.  If not, do whatever you like.  Personally,I don't see the point of having the mud if things stay as they are.**nae**To: wilbieRe:   StrikeCc: redsext, sargon, shadowmonk, nae, bobo, nunu, turbo, tinman, thumper, akira, nylakoorubDate: Mar 27jesus christ, this is such crap. i'm sorry, i try to stay out of politics, but tatsuo hasmanaged to brainwash people. so here's the deal, as faras i'm concerned.i'm gonna keep doing what i'm doing. coding, enjoying themud. it's a GAME!!!!!!! i have fun here.if you want to leave, then be my guest... *shurg* buta strike??? WHO FUCKING CARES????jesus, maybe i shouldnt mail when i'm drunk. but this is justsuch crap... whining about shit that tatsuo obviously has no clue about.wi