en to think that the best way we can make themud better is to all work together... which is CLEARLYnot what you were asking for.I'm sorry. If you open a discussion, and call forresponses, dont act like it's the end of the worldwhen they dont agree with you.**mangla**To: sargonSubj: PromotionsCc: arches, tinman, shadowmonk, brainsprain, redsexy, bobo, turboDate: Mar 31As was promised, the promotions have been made.Thanks for your time and patience.-Mangla**"
